  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ふぅ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bgm": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "緩やかに見えるけど、やっぱり上り坂だな\r\n動きやすい服で来てよかったよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002010010030,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "意外と足腰に来ますよね",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200201001/2002010010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "灯織でもそう思うのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002010010040,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "思います",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201001/2002010010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002010010050,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "少し前に、真乃とめぐると\r\nトレッキングみたいなことをしたんですけど",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201001/2002010010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002010010060,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "…………その後の筋肉痛がすごかったんです",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201001/2002010010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えっ、そうなのか？\r\n灯織には縁遠いものかと思ってたよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002010010070,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "アイドルになった最初の頃は、\r\nレッスン後や本番後によくなっていたんですけど",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201001/2002010010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002010010080,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "でも、最近はそういうのもほとんどなくて……",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201001/2002010010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002010010090,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "普段から歌って踊っているんだから大丈夫だろうって\r\n高をくくっていた自分がすごく情けなくて",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201001/2002010010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002010010100,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "一口に動くって言っても、\r\n動作によって使う部位が違うのは当然なのに……",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201001/2002010010100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほどな、それで下見か",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002010010110,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "はい。番組のスタッフさんや、\r\n共演者の方に迷惑をかけるわけにはいかないなと",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201001/2002010010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002010010120,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "３人の時は、寄り道をしたり、小休止を挟んだり、\r\n真乃がペースを作ってくれるんですけど",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201001/2002010010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002010010130,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "撮影となると、そうもいかないので……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201001/2002010010130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002010010140,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "付き合わせてしまって、すみません……\r\nプロデューサーに迷惑をかけていたら、意味ないですよね",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201001/2002010010140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002010010150,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201001/2002010010150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "灯織、違うぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002010010160,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "え……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201001/2002010010160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺が付き合いたいだけだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そう思うのは、\r\n灯織が真摯に仕事に向き合ってくれるからなんだからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002010010170,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "プロデューサー……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201001/2002010010170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "色々、本当に色々考えることもあると思うんだけどさ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "何回でも言うよ\r\nもっと頼ってくれて大丈夫、そのための俺だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002010010180,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "その……ありがとう、ございます",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_cheat",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201001/2002010010180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002010010190,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim2": "face_cheat",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201001/2002010010190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002010010200,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "あっあの！　もう少し進むとお茶屋さんがあるんです",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_cheat",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201001/2002010010200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002010010210,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "有名なところだそうで、\r\nロケでもきっとそのお店に寄ると思うので",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201001/2002010010210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002010010220,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "休憩しませんか……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201001/2002010010220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、いいな！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "灯織、相変わらずばっちり事前チェックしてるんだな\r\n頼もしいよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002010010230,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ばっちりとまでは……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201001/2002010010230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002010010240,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "準備していても、全部上手くいくわけでもないですし……！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201001/2002010010240"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
